request: Rename Todo.done to Todo.completed everywhere.

governor turn 1: plan -> types, format, storage, commands  (Changing the field name affects the Todo interface in types, and every unit that reads or writes the field (format, storage, commands) has to update at the same time. Storage moves old `done` records to `completed` so existing files still load.)
round 1: owners types=rejected format=rejected storage=rejected commands=rejected; oracle RED
